  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_01",
      "hash": "bd7450943d22dea7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，是这边！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_02",
      "hash": "bd7451943d22e05a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这间房间，\\n其实是船长室！\\c\\n船长爷爷曾是一位\\n会传授“[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘术[VAR COLOR(0000)]”的名人哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_06",
      "hash": "bd744d943d22d98e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……虽然他现在\\n因为晕船整个人病恹恹的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_03",
      "hash": "bd7452943d22e20d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "去见船长爷爷之前，\\c\\n不如让我先替你看看\\n你的宝可梦们的训练成果吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0420_dummy_01",
      "hash": "1f3758630d6ea9a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_04",
      "hash": "bd744b943d22d628",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]……\\n你怎么会这么强啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0420_rival_05",
      "hash": "bd744c943d22d7db",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……没，我什么都没说！\\c\\n你一定要\\n让船长爷爷教你[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘术[VAR COLOR(0000)]哦！"
    }
  ],
